            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When the tests disclose that the correct alignment is imminent, the desired bearing quality is worked into the headstock V-slide and flat slide, to satisfy OBJECTIVE NO. 3. Refer to Sec. 23.25. Simultaneous Achievement of Bearing Quality.",
